WEBVTT

00:00:02.218 --> 00:00:04.845
One day, I had a
close encounter with a UFO.

00:00:04.929 --> 00:00:08.182
I was given a red supersuit,
and told to save the earth.

00:00:08.265 --> 00:00:13.646
However, since I lost the
instruction book, it's been a disaster!

00:00:13.729 --> 00:00:15.189
When I fly through the air,
I collide with things,

00:00:15.272 --> 00:00:16.524
and crash into the ground.

00:00:16.607 --> 00:00:18.859
But, by partnering with
former CIA operative Manami,

00:00:18.943 --> 00:00:21.403
and former Immigration
Bureau operative Aoi,

00:00:21.487 --> 00:00:23.864
I carry out my mission like a champ!

00:00:23.948 --> 00:00:27.535
It's a heart-pounding UFO-era flight,
dressed up in a supersuit,

00:00:27.618 --> 00:00:29.453
Catian Heroine!

00:00:29.537 --> 00:00:33.082
What's going to happen this time?

00:00:41.632 --> 00:00:43.384
I'm still inexperienced

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:49.181
There are many answers before my eyes

00:00:49.265 --> 00:00:56.397
How many equal parts
can you divide one sky into?

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.274
Give me them all,
because they're so much fun

00:00:58.357 --> 00:01:00.025
I want them all to myself

00:01:00.109 --> 00:01:03.404
My true colors spill into the blue sky

00:01:03.487 --> 00:01:11.161
Man! I'll write your
name down so I don't lose it

00:01:11.245 --> 00:01:12.955
Why don't you get serious?

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:18.210
I won't let you tell me you don't like to

00:01:18.294 --> 00:01:24.967
A pure love device (Set up now) and start it up

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:29.054
On a runway of impatience and dreams

00:01:29.138 --> 00:01:32.933
fasten your seatbelt even tighter

00:01:33.017 --> 00:01:39.815
A cutting-edge device
(Back up now) it's starting up

00:01:39.898 --> 00:01:43.861
I want the original

00:01:43.944 --> 00:01:47.531
of your heart, at least,

00:01:47.615 --> 00:01:51.535
and I've put together a plan

00:01:55.998 --> 00:01:59.835
"Cat Planet Cuties"

00:02:24.401 --> 00:02:28.656
We've started fueling.
It should take about thirty minutes.

00:02:28.739 --> 00:02:30.199
Understood.

00:02:31.408 --> 00:02:33.744
Here are the NATO force battalions.

00:02:33.827 --> 00:02:36.455
They'll be in attack range before long.

00:02:36.538 --> 00:02:39.124
We're not going to make it in time.

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:44.463
Not to worry. We'll hold them back
with all we've got until you launch.

00:02:49.385 --> 00:02:51.261
What is that?!

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:01.772
This wasn't part of our exercise!

00:03:01.855 --> 00:03:05.150
This is no exercise. It's a top-secret,
off-the-books mission

00:03:05.234 --> 00:03:07.695
to eliminate these terrorists.

00:03:07.778 --> 00:03:11.740
Load canister shot!
Target the forward bike squad!

00:03:15.369 --> 00:03:17.162
Fire!

00:03:18.205 --> 00:03:19.957
How was that one, kitty?

00:03:19.957 --> 00:03:20.457
"Diroct hit”
How was that one, kitty?

00:03:20.457 --> 00:03:20.958
How was that one, kitty?

00:03:42.312 --> 00:03:44.857
Winters in the tundra are cold!

00:03:53.657 --> 00:03:56.326
Fueling is 50% complete.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:57.786
Acknowledged.

00:03:59.246 --> 00:04:04.209
You're in love with Kio, too, Manami.

00:04:04.293 --> 00:04:06.545
Don't make me remember that now.

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.382
You protect a country you do not love,

00:04:10.466 --> 00:04:13.051
and serve a planet that you do not know.

00:04:13.135 --> 00:04:16.430
You're nothing but
a mercenary-- a killer.

00:04:16.513 --> 00:04:21.769
Yes. I am a killer. I'm not fit to fall in love.

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:25.731
What's the matter, Kio?

00:04:25.814 --> 00:04:27.649
Oh, I'm just nervous.

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:30.486
I'm not even used to flying in
planes, let alone outer space.

00:04:30.569 --> 00:04:35.073
It's all right. I'm here with you,
and I am used to outer space.

00:04:35.157 --> 00:04:38.911
Hey, could you keep it in check for me?

00:04:38.994 --> 00:04:41.413
Aoi, if you're going to
tell him, now's the time.

00:04:41.497 --> 00:04:42.831
What are you talking about?

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:45.375
Once we get into space, it's all over.

00:04:45.459 --> 00:04:47.628
| told you to butt out!

00:04:47.711 --> 00:04:50.547
Are you sure?
You're going to lose your chance!

00:04:50.631 --> 00:04:52.174
Leave me alone.

00:04:52.257 --> 00:04:55.969
Manami, are you sure you don't
want to express your feelings?

00:04:56.929 --> 00:04:58.639
Why don't you butt out?!

00:04:58.722 --> 00:05:01.850
This is hard on you, too, isn't it?

00:05:03.143 --> 00:05:05.562
You've loved him all this time, right?

00:05:05.646 --> 00:05:08.398
You want to always be with him, right?

00:05:08.482 --> 00:05:12.319
You've been holding your
feelings back all this time, right?

00:05:12.402 --> 00:05:15.322
All this time... all this time...

00:05:15.405 --> 00:05:16.782
Stop it!

00:05:18.784 --> 00:05:22.037
Gunships! All units, fall back!

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.085
What's the matter, at a time like this?

00:05:28.168 --> 00:05:31.797
Now is the time when we need your help.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:34.299
| don't know the reason for your argument,

00:05:34.383 --> 00:05:38.136
--but can I ask you to make up? Please?

00:05:38.136 --> 00:05:39.763
--Stop!
--but can I ask you to make up? Please?

00:05:39.847 --> 00:05:43.809
Just stop, already!
You're the reason for all of this!

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.315
| won't let you interfere!

00:05:50.399 --> 00:05:53.944
I'm going to build my own world,
together with the kitty!

00:05:58.907 --> 00:06:04.329
Yeah! I was with Kio long
before you ever came around!

00:06:04.413 --> 00:06:06.665
| thought we would be together forever!

00:06:06.748 --> 00:06:12.170
But then you suddenly showed up,
and took everything away.

00:06:12.254 --> 00:06:13.797
Manami...

00:06:13.881 --> 00:06:16.633
It's just not fair! Where do you get off,

00:06:16.717 --> 00:06:19.303
with your kitty ears and tail,
and your big boobs,

00:06:19.386 --> 00:06:21.513
and your natural innocence,
and being an alien.

00:06:21.597 --> 00:06:26.768
Kio is such a nerd, there's no way
I'm a match for big guns like that!

00:06:26.852 --> 00:06:28.562
Manami...

00:06:28.645 --> 00:06:30.898
| thought I had given up on him.

00:06:32.065 --> 00:06:38.488
But with someone like that,
| couldn't completely give up.

00:06:38.572 --> 00:06:42.534
So then, why were you pulling for me?

00:06:42.618 --> 00:06:47.205
| don't know. Maybe because
| figured you'd give up, Aoi.

00:06:47.289 --> 00:06:52.628
Or maybe I figured that if
| could get you and Eris to quarrel...

00:06:52.711 --> 00:06:57.090
But before I knew it,
Kio was quickly getting farther away.

00:06:57.174 --> 00:06:59.134
Manami...

00:06:59.217 --> 00:07:03.430
Um... so, Manami,
you're saying that for you,

00:07:03.513 --> 00:07:08.352
Kio is someone
very important to you, right?

00:07:08.435 --> 00:07:11.772
Well then, you're just like Aoi.

00:07:15.817 --> 00:07:19.154
That's fine.
So then, let's all three of us

00:07:19.237 --> 00:07:21.073
be in love with Kio together.

00:07:21.156 --> 00:07:21.907
Huh?!

00:07:21.949 --> 00:07:24.034
W-What are you saying?

00:07:24.117 --> 00:07:27.788
Well, unlike in Catian society, on Earth,

00:07:27.871 --> 00:07:31.500
relationships that aren't
on the books are okay, right?

00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:35.504
In which case, let's all
three of us be Kio's lovers!

00:07:39.675 --> 00:07:42.636
Uh... what are we talking about?

00:07:58.986 --> 00:08:00.570
"Toach these guys a lasson!"

00:08:01.196 --> 00:08:02.572
Kitty!

00:08:14.251 --> 00:08:15.377
Maid Chief!

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:17.379
We're into stoppage time.

00:08:17.462 --> 00:08:18.964
Can you hold out?

00:08:19.047 --> 00:08:19.631
Yes!

00:08:19.631 --> 00:08:20.424
IIYBSII
Yes!

00:08:20.424 --> 00:08:20.507
<i>LIY BS“</i>

00:08:22.551 --> 00:08:25.220
Fueling complete!

00:08:25.303 --> 00:08:27.681
All personnel, stand by for launch!

00:08:27.764 --> 00:08:29.558
Miss Eris, you can take off!

00:08:29.641 --> 00:08:30.809
Acknowledged.

00:08:30.892 --> 00:08:32.060
Kio...

00:08:32.519 --> 00:08:36.064
All right. Catiearth moving out!

00:09:18.482 --> 00:09:20.358
Cat Planet Cuties!

00:09:29.534 --> 00:09:32.120
So this... is outer space...

00:09:32.204 --> 00:09:33.580
Amazing.

00:09:33.663 --> 00:09:35.123
Pretty.

00:09:35.207 --> 00:09:37.501
There are so many different countries,

00:09:37.584 --> 00:09:40.378
and billions of people
living down there, huh?

00:09:40.462 --> 00:09:40.545
It's incredible.
It would be even more incredible

00:09:40.545 --> 00:09:42.214
"The earth was blus" It's incredible.
It would be even more incredible

00:09:42.214 --> 00:09:43.256
It's incredible.
It would be even more incredible

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:44.716
if all of those people could get
along with each other.

00:09:44.716 --> 00:09:46.426
"I am a s9agull” if all of those
people could get along with each other.

00:09:46.426 --> 00:09:47.010
If all of those people could get
along with each other.

00:09:47.094 --> 00:09:48.261
No...

00:09:49.638 --> 00:09:54.684
Not just Earth-- everyone
in the universe should get along.

00:09:55.769 --> 00:09:58.438
It's jusht about time for me to do my thing.

00:09:58.522 --> 00:10:00.524
All of the Assistroids,

00:10:00.607 --> 00:10:04.152
please follow Luros
and construct a warp engine.

00:10:04.319 --> 00:10:05.946
"Okie-doke"

00:10:06.613 --> 00:10:09.574
Flying objects approaching.
Lots of them!

00:10:11.952 --> 00:10:13.787
Commence the attack.

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:16.248
We're bringing down that ship.

00:10:20.544 --> 00:10:22.879
They're obviously not friendly, huh?

00:10:22.963 --> 00:10:23.922
--We've got work.

00:10:23.922 --> 00:10:25.340
--Yeah.
--We've got work.

00:10:25.423 --> 00:10:27.467
Aoi, I'm sorry.

00:10:27.551 --> 00:10:30.178
Mm-mm, I am.

00:10:31.471 --> 00:10:33.473
Huh? What?

00:10:33.557 --> 00:10:37.352
When I think that this might be the end,

00:10:37.435 --> 00:10:39.271
somehow, I don't care anymore.

00:10:39.354 --> 00:10:41.148
Mm-hmm, me too.

00:10:49.364 --> 00:10:52.325
That's in lieu of a Christmas present.

00:10:57.455 --> 00:11:01.084
No fair! You too, Manami?!

00:11:01.168 --> 00:11:03.086
This is a much better setting
than doing it while watching

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:05.672
some geeky movie, right?

00:11:05.755 --> 00:11:08.425
All right! Then I will, too!

00:11:16.349 --> 00:11:17.934
"Alert"

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:20.020
Well then, let's do this.

00:11:20.103 --> 00:11:21.021
--Okay!

00:11:21.021 --> 00:11:22.397
--Right!
--Okay!

00:11:26.443 --> 00:11:27.944
W-What are you...

00:11:28.028 --> 00:11:31.698
We're going to draw the enemy's fire.

00:11:34.201 --> 00:11:39.956
Our top priority is delivering
you safely to the Catia Ship, Kio.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.751
We'll defend you with our lives.

00:11:42.834 --> 00:11:45.420
That's crazy! There are too many of them!

00:11:45.503 --> 00:11:47.172
Kio, a while ago,

00:11:47.255 --> 00:11:49.925
