00:11:52.636 --> 00:11:54.304
Is that true now?

00:11:56.139 --> 00:11:57.307
Mm-mm.

00:11:59.851 --> 00:12:03.855
Then you do what needs to be done.

00:12:03.939 --> 00:12:05.815
If you please.

00:12:05.899 --> 00:12:07.859
Mm-hmm, leave it to me!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.997
Eris moving out!

00:12:23.208 --> 00:12:25.877
