00:13:01.121 --> 00:13:04.624
"Tims for us to go"

00:13:17.387 --> 00:13:19.556
| won't let you go!

00:13:21.391 --> 00:13:23.351
Oh no you don't!

00:13:29.691 --> 00:13:31.276
Move it!

00:14:07.812 --> 00:14:09.189
Ow-w-w...

00:14:10.565 --> 00:14:12.025
