00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:19.741
Impact starboard.
There's an object in contact with us.

00:14:19.824 --> 00:14:21.159
They're here!

00:14:21.242 --> 00:14:23.078
All hands, take up your arms!

00:14:23.161 --> 00:14:24.954
Commence counterattack!

00:15:03.743 --> 00:15:05.120
Ow-w-w...

00:15:08.957 --> 00:15:11.709
How dare you interfere! Down you go!

00:15:22.971 --> 00:15:24.848
