00:15:24.931 --> 00:15:26.891
Hey, look at that!

00:15:29.018 --> 00:15:32.272
They rebuilt our laser ranging
equipment into an optical weapon?!

00:15:34.816 --> 00:15:36.609
Everyone, fall back!

00:15:39.529 --> 00:15:40.697
What?!

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:48.413
Kakazu Kio?

00:15:48.496 --> 00:15:50.081
Melwin!

00:15:56.004 --> 00:15:58.131
This is the computer room?

00:16:00.216 --> 00:16:02.343
Yell out "restart" in there.

00:16:02.427 --> 00:16:05.388
All right! Computer, restart!

00:16:11.936 --> 00:16:13.855
Request denied.

00:16:13.938 --> 00:16:16.232
Huh? Why?!

00:16:16.316 --> 00:16:21.029
