top-level command codes.

00:16:21.112 --> 00:16:27.243
Your genetic profile is roughly
1/100,000 of a percent non-Catian.

00:16:28.703 --> 00:16:29.787
Oh, no...

00:16:36.669 --> 00:16:40.256
The bell! Use the bell to
manipulate your genetics!

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:41.883
It can do that?

00:16:41.966 --> 00:16:46.137
Yes! That's what makes
it a multitasking organizer!

00:16:46.221 --> 00:16:47.388
All right...

00:16:47.889 --> 00:16:49.974
Make me a Catian!

00:16:53.853 --> 00:16:55.438
What kind of attack is this?!

00:16:55.522 --> 00:16:57.190
It's all I can do just to avoid it!

00:16:57.273 --> 00:16:59.067
I"'m C o m 1 N 9 I

00:17:01.945 --> 00:17:03.905
Why, you...!

00:17:06.157 --> 00:17:07.325
What?!

00:17:08.618 --> 00:17:10.870
Everyone, now!

00:17:10.954 --> 00:17:12.330
--Final Rays!
--Final Rays! --Final Rays!

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.420
--QX cannons, fire!
--QX cannons, fire! --QX cannons, fire!

00:17:23.466 --> 00:17:26.135
A hyperspace graviton blast?!

00:17:29.764 --> 00:17:31.015
All right!

00:17:31.099 --> 00:17:32.684
We did it!

00:17:35.478 --> 00:17:37.730
It's no use! I can't control it!

00:17:37.814 --> 00:17:39.941
Matrey, do something!

00:17:40.984 --> 00:17:42.151
"I'm afraid I cannot"

00:17:51.953 --> 00:17:53.913
