00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:57.834
Ah! Oh, no!

00:17:57.917 --> 00:17:59.294
What's wrong, Eris?!

00:17:59.377 --> 00:18:02.422
The base is going to fall to Earth!

00:18:02.505 --> 00:18:05.258
The way it's headed, it's going to
fall over a radius of 300 kilometers,

00:18:05.341 --> 00:18:07.385
