00:18:08.469 --> 00:18:09.512
Aoi!

00:18:09.596 --> 00:18:10.972
Please wait!

00:18:14.726 --> 00:18:16.894
Chiba-chan, gauge it.

00:18:19.439 --> 00:18:21.190
If we increase its reentry angle,

00:18:21.274 --> 00:18:23.693
