burn up in the atmosphere.

00:18:24.152 --> 00:18:24.652
"Warning"

00:18:24.652 --> 00:18:26.362
"Warning"
No fuel? Even so...

00:18:26.362 --> 00:18:27.280
No fuel? Even so...

