atmospheric reentry.

00:19:07.612 --> 00:19:09.864
Calculate a way to save them!

00:19:11.282 --> 00:19:11.949
"No answer"

00:19:12.116 --> 00:19:15.119
Oh, no! Anything goes,
just give me the odds!

00:19:15.203 --> 00:19:16.996
I'll take whatever means are necessary,

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:18.873
