00:19:19.374 --> 00:19:20.083
"No answer"

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.876
Please!

00:19:24.379 --> 00:19:28.466
| didn't mind.
After all, I'm just a killer,

00:19:28.549 --> 00:19:33.638
