country she doesn't even love.

00:19:33.721 --> 00:19:38.226
Does fighting for the people you
love not count?

00:19:38.309 --> 00:19:41.854
Oh, yeah. I guess there is that.

00:19:41.938 --> 00:19:46.943
I'm sorry, Kin-chan, Chiba-chan.

00:19:47.026 --> 00:19:48.820
That's enough, Yun-fat.

00:19:53.241 --> 00:19:55.410
Thank you.

00:19:55.493 --> 00:19:59.288
