00:19:59.372 --> 00:20:01.082
Me, too.

00:20:01.165 --> 00:20:04.043
Bye-bye, Aoi.

00:20:04.127 --> 00:20:06.170
Bye-bye, Manami.

00:20:10.967 --> 00:20:13.219
Manami! Futabal!

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.892
