00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:56.846
Kio!

00:20:56.929 --> 00:20:57.722
Kio!

00:20:57.764 --> 00:20:58.765
Kio!

00:20:58.848 --> 00:21:00.266
Welcome back, everyone!

00:21:00.349 --> 00:21:01.809
We're back!

